 "target": "diarrhea-constipation",
 "ops": [
  {
   "op": "append",
   "sec": "con-def",
   "html": "<p><b>Blackbook (Constipation):</b> Infrequency (&lt; 3 bowel movements/week)? Sensation of blockage or incomplete evacuation? Straining?</p>"
  },
  {
   "op": "append",
   "sec": "con-c2",
   "html": "<p><b>Blackbook — Altered bowel function: Diet/Lifestyle</b></p><ul><li>Fibre</li><li>Calories</li><li>Fluid</li><li>Exercise</li><li>Psychosocial</li></ul>"
  },
  {
   "op": "append",
   "sec": "con-c6",
   "html": "<p><b>Blackbook — Altered bowel function: Medications</b></p><ul><li>Neurally Active Medications (e.g. Opiates, Anti-Hypertensives)</li><li>Cation Related (e.g. Iron, Aluminum, Calcium, Potassium)</li><li>Anticholinergic (e.g. Antispasmodics, Antidepressants, Antipsychotics)</li></ul>"
  },
  {
   "op": "append",
   "sec": "con-c7",
   "html": "<p><b>Blackbook — Severe idiopathic:</b> Colonic Inertia · Outlet Delay (Pelvic Floor Dyssynergia) · Irritable Bowel</p>"
  },
  {
   "op": "append",
   "sec": "con-c4",
   "html": "<p><b>Blackbook — Secondary causes: Colorectal Disease</b></p><ul><li>Colon Cancer</li><li>Colonic Stricture (Inflammatory Bowel Disease and Diverticular Disease)</li></ul>"
  },
  {
   "op": "append",
   "sec": "con-cause",
   "html": "<p><b>Blackbook — Secondary causes: Neurogenic / Non-Neurogenic</b></p><h4>Neurogenic — Peripheral</h4><ul><li>Hirschsprung’s Disease</li><li>Autonomic Neuropathy</li><li>Pseudo-obstruction</li></ul><h4>Neurogenic — Central</h4><ul><li>Multiple Sclerosis</li><li>Parkinson’s Disease</li><li>Spinal Cord/Sacral/Cauda Equina Injury</li></ul><h4>Non-Neurogenic — Metabolic</h4><ul><li>Hypothyroidism</li><li>Hypokalemia</li><li>Hypercalcemia</li></ul>"
  },
  {
   "op": "sec",
   "after": "con-cause",
   "id": "bb-086-scheme",
   "h": "Constipation (Adult) schemes — Altered bowel function / Idiopathic / Secondary causes (Blackbook)",
   "html": "<div class=\"flow\" data-flow=\"b086a\"></div><div class=\"flow\" data-flow=\"b086b\"></div>"
  }
